{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "今天能做什么",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 80.05,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "spoken": "最后，每个人今天就能做一件事。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 3.264,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 4.031
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "写合约的人，检查每个交换函数：最小输出和截止时间，是不是由调用者传进来。",
   "spoken": "写合约的人，检查每个交换函数：最小输出和截止时间，是不是由掉用者传进来。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 5.084,
   "dur": 7.272,
   "speechStart": 5.182,
   "speechEnd": 11.515
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "所有签名，用 EIP-712，带上 nonce 和截止时间。",
   "spoken": "所有签名，用 EIP-712，带上 nonce 和截止时间。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 12.576,
   "dur": 5.568,
   "speechStart": 12.674,
   "speechEnd": 17.305
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "审计的人，拿同一份签名提交第二次。第二次也成功，就是漏洞。",
   "spoken": "审计的人，拿同一份签名提交第二次。第二次也成功，就是漏洞。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 18.364,
   "dur": 6.576,
   "speechStart": 18.462,
   "speechEnd": 24.102
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "修复要两个结果：修复前，重放成功；修复后，被拦下。",
   "spoken": "修复要两个结果：修复前，虫放成功；修复后，被拦下。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 25.16,
   "dur": 6.024,
   "speechStart": 25.258,
   "speechEnd": 30.353
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "普通用户，大额兑换设合理的滑点，不用自动的高滑点，可以走私有交易通道。",
   "spoken": "普通用户，大额兑换设合理的滑点，不用自动的高滑点，可以走私有交易通道。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 31.404,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 31.502,
   "speechEnd": 37.752
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "签名前看清链 ID、合约地址、数额和期限。钱包只显示哈希，或者提示盲签，就不签。",
   "spoken": "签名前看清链 ID、合约地址、数额和期限。钱包只显示哈希，或者提示盲签，就不签。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 38.824,
   "dur": 8.664,
   "speechStart": 38.922,
   "speechEnd": 46.657
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "回到开头。滑点设 5%，为什么可能真的付 5%？",
   "spoken": "回到开头。滑点设 5%，为什么可能真的付 5%？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 47.708,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 47.806,
   "speechEnd": 52.494
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "因为交易在打包之前是公开的，滑点就是你公开的最差报价。",
   "spoken": "因为交易在打包之前是公开的，滑点就是你公开的最差报价。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 53.824,
   "dur": 5.304,
   "speechStart": 53.922,
   "speechEnd": 58.279
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "这在交易走公开内存池时成立。走私有通道，搜索者在打包前看不到它。",
   "spoken": "这在交易走公开内存池时成立。走私有通道，搜索者在打包前看不到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 59.348,
   "dur": 7.2,
   "speechStart": 59.446,
   "speechEnd": 65.693
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "顺序可以被买，签名可以被重放。",
   "spoken": "顺序可以被买，签名可以被虫放。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 66.768,
   "dur": 3.384,
   "speechStart": 66.866,
   "speechEnd": 69.33
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "签之前看清内容，发之前想好，谁会先看到它。",
   "spoken": "签之前看清内容，发之前想好，谁会先看到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep09/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 70.372,
   "dur": 4.92,
   "speechStart": 70.47,
   "speechEnd": 74.446
  },
  {
